// Synthetic test file #333 - mimics a typical clang/test RUN-line density
// (avg ~5 RUN lines/file, matching the measured clang/test average) using
// the stateless wrapper tools targeted by this experiment (true/false/count),
// plus 'not' as a control (already inlined by upstream lit, so its cost
// should be identical between baseline and optimized runs).
